NAME:          ice_crevasse_bridge
DESC:          A crevasse opened across the trail and somebody bridged it with a single snow span; the register of who crossed is cairned at the far end.
TAGS:          signature ice crevasse bridge
FLOORS:        *
BIOME:         ice
WEIGHT:        25
MAX_PER_FLOOR: 1
ROTATE:        true
MIRROR:        true

KFEAT: s = Snow
KFEAT: O = Rock

